// Content profiles: which XML files the client bundles and, for the local
// test profiles, which corpus files stand in for the shipped baseline.
//
// The shipped baseline lives under apps/client/public/content and has three
// parts: the core rules baseline (`core/`), the System Reference Document 5.1
// subset (`srd-5.1/`) and the System Reference Document 5.2.1 subset
// (`srd-5.2.1/`). Both SRD subsets are generated by
// scripts/build-srd-content.mjs from the vendored corpus and the reviewed maps
// under third-party/srd-5.1 and third-party/srd-5.2; the few authored files in
// those directories are listed with them. The raw corpus tree itself is never
// bundled; it reaches the browser only through the upload flow or the explicit
// local test profiles below.

